{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104471","id":2411000922,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6PtPRa","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104471","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104471.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104471.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104471","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104471/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104471/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104471/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b48849742071a0d69a7d09ada518a568f7504dbe","number":104471,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Normalize path separators in error and warning logs on Windows","user":{"login":"Andrewyuan34","id":107494519,"node_id":"U_kgDOBmg8dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107494519?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34","html_url":"https://github.com/Andrewyuan34","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# Fix inconsistent path separators in error and warning logs on Windows\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\nOn Windows systems, error and warning logs display file paths with mixed backslashes (`\\`) and forward slashes (`/`). This occurs because paths are not normalized before logging. Example logs:\r\n\r\n\r\n<summary>Collision Warning Example</summary>\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n// core/templates/a_hash_map.h:190\r\nWARNING: Excessive collision count (13), is the right hash function being used?\r\n   at: AHashMap<class String,...>::_insert_with_hash (C:\\Users\\user\\godot\\core/templates/a_hash_map.h:190)\r\n```\r\n\r\n<summary>Input Error</summary>\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nERROR: Condition \"button == MouseButton::NONE\" is true. Returning: MouseButtonMask::NONE\r\n   at: mouse_button_to_mask (C:\\Users\\user\\godot\\core/input/input_enums.h:136)\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\n### Path Normalization\r\n- Replaced backslashes (`\\`) with forward slashes (`/`) in logging functions.\r\n- Added path normalization before passing paths to logging systems.\r\n\r\n### Memory Safety\r\n- Explicitly stored `CharString` objects to extend buffer lifetime.\r\n- Prevented dangling pointers via proper lifetime management.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/